===Noun===
{{en-noun|head=[[endocrine]] [[gland]]}}

# {{context|anatomy|lang=en}} Any of various glands that secrete [[hormone]]s directly into the [[blood]] or [[lymph]] and not through a duct.

====Synonyms====
* [[ductless gland]]

====Antonyms====
* [[exocrine gland]]

